    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1.3
  m_Text: "\r\nThe rhythm of tango and the power of the Pampas.\n In a land dancing
    between ice and fire, the Silver Feather was awarded to dancers and warriors
    who mastered the balance between beauty and strength.\n It is nature\u2019s gift
    to the children of the plains, a symbol of pride for those who face challenges
    with an indomitable Latin spirit.\n Win it through the Argentina mode, and let
    your rhythm write the glory.\n"
