    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "The light of the ocean and the song of buried treasure.\n In islands that
    shimmer above Caribbean waters, the Diamond Feather was surrounded by legends.
    It is said to appear only to those who hear the whisper of the sea and understand
    the secrets of pearls.\n It is the crown of noble pirates and the mark of those
    who sail through storms with the steadiness and strength of diamonds.\n Claim
    it in Bahamas mode, and become the true treasure among the waves."
